      "created_at": "2016-01-23T02:32:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It has been said that the box art for broken city had some criticism. I am just wondering how people rate the art on the boxes. For me it comes in the following order</p><p>1)&nbsp;<span>Sentinels core game box (I have the big box addition) </span></p><p><span>2) Flame of Freedom (although the sides are bland)</span></p><p><span>3) A&nbsp;</span><span>tie between Villians and Warth</span></p><p><span>4) Shattered timelines</span></p><p>5) Uprising (again bland sides)</p><p><span>6) A tie between rook city and infernal relics</span></p><p><span>7) last place is vengeance.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
