      "created_at": "2016-01-24T10:13:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I really like the layout of the original SotM box, both front and sides, it's almost like a movie poster. Now that Adam's skill has progressed I'd love to see him redo it (not that I think it's going to happen). I also like the cover of For Profit, it's very evocative of the characters and what they are about.</p>",
